Name Easter Note - Terevaka #3


Interactability_Text_Line_0 Log: 5/6/18 - Terevaka Outpost
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ------
Interactability_Text_Line_2 We’ve been receiving reports that stone tablets in the caves of Terevaka have begun glowing. Not just randomly either, text appeared on them, what’s odd is that instead of being written in Glyphs or some ancient language they're all written in English.